  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f424be585f9e04c79a96c8292e8b9db1, type: 3}
  m_Name: Carta_RedeSolarDistribuida
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: "Rede Solar Distribu\xEDda"
  _titleEn: Distributed Solar Network
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Pain\xE9is solares em telhados de casas, escolas e pr\xE9dios p\xFAblicos
    geram energia perto de onde ela \xE9 usada."
  _summaryEn: Solar panels on the roofs of homes, schools and public buildings generate
    power close to where it is used.
  _realWorld: "No Brasil, a gera\xE7\xE3o distribu\xEDda cresceu r\xE1pido e ganhou
    um marco legal com a Lei 14.300, de 2022, que define como a energia excedente
    \xE9 compensada na conta."
  _realWorldEn: In Brazil, distributed generation grew fast and gained a legal framework
    with Law 14,300 of 2022, which sets how surplus power is credited on the bill.
  _tradeOffs: "Quem n\xE3o tem telhado ou dinheiro para instalar fica de fora, e
    muita gera\xE7\xE3o ao meio-dia sobrecarrega a rede."
  _tradeOffsEn: People without a roof or money to install are left out, and too much
    midday generation strains the grid.
  _sources:
  - Label: Lei 14.300/2022 (Planalto)
    Url: https://www.planalto.gov.br/ccivil_03/_ato2019-2022/2022/lei/l14300.htm
